        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>8 Inch Offset Door Pull, Rockwood BF156</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 8\" Center to Center (CTC)  commercial offset door pull is made from 1\" diameter solid round bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 4 different materials in 7 finish choices.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Aluminum: Clear Anodized Aluminum or Duro (Dark Bronze).</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass: Polished Brass or Satin Brass finish.</li>\r\n<li>Solid Bronze: Oil Rubbed Bronze finish.</li>\r\n<li>Solid Stainless Steel: Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Rockwood BF156 8\" Offset Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware: 1/4-20 </li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
